1
00:00:00,099 --> 00:00:02,045
Ok, jeg var skeptisk til disse.

2
00:00:02,045 --> 00:00:04,279
Jeg var litt skeptisk, ærlig talt.

3
00:00:04,279 --> 00:00:06,059
Men jeg tok på meg disse før

4
00:00:06,059 --> 00:00:07,319
gåturen i morges.

5
00:00:07,319 --> 00:00:09,579
Vått, gjørmete, snø overalt.

6
00:00:09,579 --> 00:00:11,920
Etterpå, helt tørre sokker.

7
00:00:11,920 --> 00:00:13,991
Ingen snø i skoene, ingen grus,

8
00:00:13,991 --> 00:00:14,659
ingenting.

9
00:00:14,659 --> 00:00:16,128
De satt på hele veien.

10
00:00:16,128 --> 00:00:18,333
Ikke noe styr, ingenting som gled

11
00:00:18,333 --> 00:00:18,699
ned.

12
00:00:18,699 --> 00:00:20,219
Nå tar jeg dem med hver gang.

13
00:00:20,219 --> 00:00:22,771
Skogen, hundeturen, vandringen,

14
00:00:22,771 --> 00:00:23,859
samme greia.

15
00:00:23,859 --> 00:00:25,757
Enkel sak, men den fungerer

16
00:00:25,757 --> 00:00:26,919
faktisk.
